Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… V…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙 为了我和快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马 有什么来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.87,0:00:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（卡耶斯特斯）喔～！ 嘿呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（惨叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马！ 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这里是 到底是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是 异世界的夹缝…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是… 阿里特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）把我扔在一边你打算去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你的了断还没 结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.70,0:01:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根本没打算和你打！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么时候起 连同伴的仇都报不了了变得这么窝囊了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个大块头这样他也死不瞑目啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.73,0:01:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 是你把戈修给……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 倒是个挺热血的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但根本不是现在的我的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修…… 那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.03,0:01:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是孩子们希望啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望…… 说起来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种胡话你确实说过来着。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.53,0:01:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((还要 打吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈修）那还用说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度就倒下 谁受得了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的肩上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是肩负着孩子们的希望啊！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 连同那份希望都被我给碾碎就是了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 你到底是怎么了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我进行过热血决斗的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不该是那种家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么梦话呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。你也曾经和戈修一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾给众多孩子们带来过希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是在说那座遗迹的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那里所描绘的传说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((喔～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔～ 哈啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）喔～！))
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（欢呼）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个传说正是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你作为人类活着时的真正的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((大家：阿里特！阿里特！阿里特！))
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你曾给予的希望应该和戈什是一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.60,0:03:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我给大家带来希望……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（千尊主）别被迷惑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你所拥有的，只有被诅咒的过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你被杀害时的憎恨！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.53,0:03:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为有那段可憎的过去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才成为了巴利安转生重生！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是我的真正姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.69,0:04:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，决斗吧，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手，阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没打算和你决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还在说这种话吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.74,0:04:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让你见识一下这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.83,0:04:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样总该有点干劲了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 你的心已经堕落到这种地步了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的阿里特 说什么都没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 先攻归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再特殊召唤 我我我小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有我我我怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将 我我我小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个效果特殊召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以和场上的 我我我怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成相同等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级提升！ 我我我小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（我我我小子）我我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级４的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我小子 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.３９！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我将 １张卡盖伏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快 就出现了吗 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但今天的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可有点不一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么情况？这种感觉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你也感觉到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。好像有什么魔物附在身上一样…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔物…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.65,0:07:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被诅咒的过去将我的拳头染成漆黑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的拳头所劈开的是悲伤的暗黑地狱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）来了能把你们彻底击溃的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法·七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？这张卡是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们七皇的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将 超百 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.28,0:08:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组无视召唤条件{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.105！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳斗士 流星之拳套！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一上来就是 超百 No.吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}惊讶还太早了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 第七之壹还可以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.58,0:08:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的 超百 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌化 并升阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ CNo.105！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那副身姿 正是燃烧拳斗士的绝对王者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧拳斗士彗星之拳套！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.65,0:09:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！ 一下子就 混沌化！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个感觉是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以前明明感觉不到{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与异晶界世界的融合开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在却能清楚地感觉到。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是因千尊之力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诞生出来的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在那里吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}何！？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来！千尊！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵，终于察觉到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后你就是九十九游马吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是千尊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，是你操控了阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是为了让我取回力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而复苏的灵魂之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马要恨的话，就去恨星光体吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗，一切的开端
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为将混沌从理想中剥离{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体世界的那个愚蠢的决定。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体世界不过是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在追求更高层次的世界罢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你却说那很愚蠢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}理想与混沌宇宙与混沌本是一体两面。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此，星光体世界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是选择了跨越混沌的道路！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:10:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也罢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.95,0:11:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你们，我倒是心存感激。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的混沌在星光体世界那种
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}封闭的世界里太过憋屈了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们将我释放到了自由的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遗迹的 No.们之所以拥有强大的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为封印着我的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算得不到 No.们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要那个封印被解开{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的力量就会逐渐复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧… 那也就是说我们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特意把你的封印给解开了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们亲手从潘多拉的盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}释放出了混沌。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 所有的世界都将被混沌吞噬。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有本事的话就来阻止我试试看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}库库库库… 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就要和千尊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到会变成要战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，这只是那家伙的分身。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本体的能量可不止这种程度！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，游马，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彗星之卡厄斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个混沌超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方一只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予其攻击力数值的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎吧，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力是2500！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下这份伤害吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！游马，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！还没卡厄斯的攻击还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就是最后一击了！直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彗星爆炸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！我和你的对决{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能就这么轻易结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将手牌中的我我我守卫者\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在受到直接攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.93,0:13:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将手牌中的这张卡以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.99,0:13:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我就只能将那只怪兽击碎了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彗星之凯斯特斯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗中破坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击力数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赐予你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 我我我守卫者的另一个效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将1张手牌送入墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效这只怪兽的破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…。游马的生命值已经只剩200了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！我盖放1张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。没想到竟然瞄准了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合击杀…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，对手是阿里特的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度我早有心理准备了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你在享受什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才没在享受呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，算是高兴吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的阿里特被上千主上操控着。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的话就不是真正的阿里特了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我要把阿里特恢复清醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.95,0:14:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场决斗中该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是找到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要打倒那个分身阿里特一定会……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 千尊的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能不能那么容易解开……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事 我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但无论如何 我一定会想办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《还是老样子的回答啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:15:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 若是以前会感到不安 但如今……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我也愿意相信你那相信他人的力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何 一定会想办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话为我们而战{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的意念就要白白浪费了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对要从千尊的咒缚中　把阿里特…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.08,0:15:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了。　在 No.遗迹里进行的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和戈什的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候　一起战斗的德罗瓦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是真心想要找回戈什的心意。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且　那份心意传达到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此　我们也要用那份…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.65,0:15:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不　要用更胜于此的心意去碰撞就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说　只要决斗　我们的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能传达到。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧　阿里特！　我的回合　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 帮一把骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（帮一把骑士）嘿咻！嘿咻！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.16,0:16:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 等级4的 我我我守卫者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.92,0:16:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和帮一把骑士 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用战士族2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.77,0:16:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身披光芒 现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}劈开黑暗的 耀眼王者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:29.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英豪冠军 断钢剑王！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！想起我们的友情吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你曾是一起热爱决斗的伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说我是伙伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}断钢剑王只有在自己的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}500以下时才能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗了 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}断钢剑王 攻击 卡埃斯托斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在这个瞬间断钢剑王的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把所有的叠放单位都用上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间攻击力变成２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 攻击力４０００！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一刀两断！必杀神剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起你那炽热的灵魂吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（阿里特）呵呵呵… 真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在 受到战斗伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌把燃烧拳击手 掩护者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能让那个伤害变成零。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是 No.卡的话就破坏不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你刚才的那次攻击算是白费了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 凭刚才的攻击还是打不到阿里特吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖放１张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.16,0:17:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，这个回合就做个了断！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值只剩200了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是，我们的墓地里刚才那个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用Excalibur的超量素材时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送进墓地的救魔骑士还在。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救魔骑士在手牌为零的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.28,0:18:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以结束战斗从场上特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有这个效果的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤燃烧拳击手 护头拳手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（护头拳手）哼 哼 哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼呵呵呵呵……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔，这种感觉是怎么回事……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的燃烧拳击手 掩护拳手和
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}护头拳手进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.81,0:18:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.80！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}缠附于狂暴之魂的 咒缚之铠！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狂装霸王 狂想曲·in·狂战！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个 No.是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力为零的 No.？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要特意用这种 No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:03.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是那个难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动狂想曲·in·狂战的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次取除一个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方墓地里的 魔法或陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或者怪兽卡中选一种{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:19.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个种类 全部除外！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.05,0:19:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要选的是…… 怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的墓地里有助骑士在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我会忘了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被看穿了吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 能保护你们的东西已经没有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 狂想曲·in·狂战士的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.46,0:19:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为自己怪兽的装备卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.63,0:19:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使那只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.87,0:19:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升１２００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉到了……那 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊的力量……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.61,0:20:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 千尊的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把凯斯特斯强化了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的意思吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看着吧 我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）唔。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 凯斯特斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击艾克斯卡利巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 还没完呢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 叠放碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 我的怪兽叠放
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那场战斗无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 凯斯特斯的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.80,0:20:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后！ 将作为攻击对象的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽叠放解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组将 等级１的怪兽２只
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效化并特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:21:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ 暗黑隆！ 栗子球特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（栗子球特）栗～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（暗黑隆）呵呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 真是个难缠的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 No. 他的咒缚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉变得更加强烈了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此 我们也只能走自己的路！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:22.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是千尊的诅咒更强{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.27,0:21:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是我们之间的友情更强！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 要唤醒他的记忆说到卡的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们还有 那张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狮子之心吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那张 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对于使用它的我们来说 也很危险。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事 我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那家伙所拥有的记忆本身啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《遗迹的 No.卡是 阿里特的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.45,0:21:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而 这张混沌超百
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是千尊的诅咒…》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道… 是这么回事吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解开阿里特诅咒的方法！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.82,0:22:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.29,0:27:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次超爱大海的艺人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.36,0:27:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鹤野先生的大海尽情兜风！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}舞台是面朝太平洋的度假胜地……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀～
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.26,0:27:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不错啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.29,0:27:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过今天风稍微有点大呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.47,0:27:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实挺大的……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.38,0:27:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 那个只有一个人嗨成那样的感觉。

